    "intro_narrative": "You wake up in a damp, neon-lit alleyway in the underbelly of Neo-Kowloon. The rain washes over the cybernetic debris scattered around you. A megacorporation's purge protocol has trapped you in this sector, and the only way out is to reactivate an abandoned communication array to broadcast an encrypted distress signal. You must interface with forgotten tech, bypass rogue security modules, and scavenge old hardware to weave your way through the local network. Time is running out before the hunter drones arrive. Connect the fragmented systems, decode the data trail, and escape.",
